Options -Indexes

# Extra lock on /admin: use cPanel → Directory Privacy, or uncomment
# the block below AFTER creating .htpasswd with an ABSOLUTE path.
#
# Do not use <IfFile> or AuthUserFile "${DOCUMENT_ROOT}/..." — both
# 500 on LiteSpeed/cPanel when credentials are submitted.
#
#   htpasswd -c /home/bizdavar/public_html/admin/.htpasswd YOUR_USER
#   (omit -B; bcrypt hashes 500 on LiteSpeed)
#
# AuthType Basic
# AuthName "BizHub"
# AuthUserFile /home/bizdavar/public_html/admin/.htpasswd
# Require valid-user

# Stop parent ErrorDocument from looping on 401/500 inside /admin/
ErrorDocument 401 default
ErrorDocument 403 default
ErrorDocument 500 default
